{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runpod/runpodctl/pulls/331","id":4370086382,"node_id":"PR_kwDOHHW5XM8AAAABBHo57g","html_url":"https://github.com/runpod/runpodctl/pull/331","diff_url":"https://github.com/runpod/runpodctl/pull/331.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/runpod/runpodctl/pull/331.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runpod/runpodctl/issues/331","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runpod/runpodctl/pulls/331/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runpod/runpodctl/pulls/331/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runpod/runpodctl/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runpod/runpodctl/issues/331/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runpod/runpodctl/statuses/9188ca5cb61010f8335234a1d58df2eeae061ef7","number":331,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(pod): restore --stop-after and --terminate-after, validated","user":{"login":"justinwlin","id":15874969,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODc0OTY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15874969?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinwlin","html_url":"https://github.com/justinwlin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinwlin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinwlin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinwlin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinwlin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinwlin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinwlin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinwlin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinwlin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinwlin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Brings back `--stop-after` and `--terminate-after`, removed in #330, with every client-side way of losing the deadline closed.\n\n**Do not merge until the API enforces the timer.** Until then #330's removal is the correct behaviour, and this PR would put the silent-billing failure straight back. Stacked on #330.\n\n## What this fixes\n\n| Problem | Fix |\n|---|---|\n| Docs advertise `1h`, `24h`, `7d`; the GraphQL `DateTime` scalar rejects them | `duration.ParseDeadline` resolves durations against the clock and sends RFC 3339 |\n| Raw GraphQL scalar error leaked to the user | Rejected locally, before the create call, so a bad value never costs a billed pod |\n| Past timestamps accepted, deadline never arrives | Rejected, with the current time in the message |\n| CPU pods accept the flag and silently drop it (REST v2 has no scheduling field) | Errors instead |\n| No confirmation the timer was applied | Resolved deadline echoed to stderr |\n\n```\n$ runpodctl pod create --gpu-id \"NVIDIA RTX 4000 Ada Generation\" --image ubuntu:22.04 --stop-after 4m\nnote: auto-stop scheduled for 2026-08-26T16:48:35Z\n{ \"id\": \"bdwcl5lzqwqny0\", ... }\n```\n\n## What it does not fix\n\nWhether the pod actually stops. `stopAfter` / `terminateAfter` are write-only from a client: valid input on `PodFindAndDeployOnDemandInput`, not readable on the `Pod` type, absent from REST v2. The CLI cannot verify the deadline landed, so the stderr note describes what was sent, not what will happen. Enforcement is an API-side change.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Verification</summary>\n\nLive against production:\n\n```\n$ runpodctl pod create --compute-type CPU --image ubuntu:22.04 --stop-after 2h\n{\"error\":\"--stop-after is not supported for compute type CPU; ...\",\"code\":\"cli_error\"}\n\n$ runpodctl pod create --gpu-id \"NVIDIA A40\" --image ubuntu:22.04 --stop-after \"1h ago\"\n{\"error\":\"invalid --stop-after: invalid time \\\"1h ago\\\": use a duration like 2h, 7d or an rfc3339 timestamp ...\",\"code\":\"cli_error\"}\n\n$ runpodctl pod create --gpu-id \"NVIDIA A40\" --image ubuntu:22.04 --terminate-after \"2020-01-01T00:00:00Z\"\n{\"error\":\"invalid --terminate-after: ... must be in the future (now is 2026-08-26T16:44:26Z)\",\"code\":\"cli_error\"}\n```\n\nUnit tests: `TestResolvePodSchedule`, `TestResolvePodScheduleNotesTheDeadline`, `TestParseDeadline`. `go test ./...` green.\n</details>\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-26T19:20:24Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T22:51:24Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"runpod:justinlin/con-1258-client-validate-schedule-flags","ref":"justinlin/con-1258-client-validate-schedule-flags","repo":{"id":477477212,"node_id":"R_kgDOHHW5XA","name":"runpodctl","full_name":"runpod/runpodctl","owner":{"login":"runpod","id":95939477,"node_id":"O_kgDOBbfrlQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95939477?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runpod","html_url":"https://github.com/runpod","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runpod/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runpod/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runpod/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runpod/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runpod/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runpod/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runpod/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runpod/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runpod/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"interact with Runpod via the cli","homepage":"https://www.runpod.io/","language":"Go","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":["cli","command-line","docker","file-transf